WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.800
Aoyama-kun!

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.400
Hi.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.100
Well then, see you later, Ichigo!

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.400
Enjoy your date!

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.030
Sorry, I’m in a hurry. See you.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.360
Oh, that was cold...

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.860
Did you have a quarrel or something?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.030
Eh? No, we didn’t!

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.320
Then why?

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.340
You’re a new couple. This is strange.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:30.970
Do you think so?

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.300
Now that you mention it, he turned
down a date on Sunday...

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.750
Could it be that he’s lost
interest in you?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.040
Don’t tell me...!

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.830
Come off it, Moe.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.210
Don’t take her word for it, Ichigo.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.420
But...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.520
I know! How about asking
Mariko-senpai?

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.490
Mariko-senpai?

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.100
So, is that the device for locating Mew Aqua?

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.450
Yes. It will locate a possible position.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.320
Just “possible”?

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.080
Unless it’s activated, Mew Aqua
has only a faint signature.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.990
That is what we learned from the last event.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.950
Another reason we cannot locate it for sure, is...

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.630
it does not have a fixed form.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.830
Which means...?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:26.190
Which means, in theory, it could be hidden in anything.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:31.150
Heh, so maybe a human has some without realizing it?

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:36.110
Possibly. Humans mine many ores and metals, so...

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:38.940
Sounds like a lot of bother.

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:46.540
What’s this line for?

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:51.570
They’re waiting for their turn to see Mariko-senpai.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:55.320
She’s really famous for her fortune
telling with the crystal ball.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.660
She is?

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:59.660
Ichigo, consult her about Aoyama-kun!

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:00.670
Eh?

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.760
Thank you so much, Mariko-senpai!

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.840
Who’s next? Come in!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.190
Y-Yes!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.510
Go, Ichigo!

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:15.890
Good luck.

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:16.820
Yeah...

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:29.370
Umm, good afternoon.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.340
Geez, she’s scary...

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:38.010
Oh, sorry. I scare people because I’m unfriendly.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.080
Eh?

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.300
You thought I was scary, right?

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.500
N-No, I just...

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.890
Now, come here!

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.220
Yes.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.050
And? What am I supposed to tell you about?

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.720
Umm, as a matter of fact...

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:56.900
So you are uneasy about
your boyfriend.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.890
H-How can you tell that?!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.580
I haven’t said anything yet!

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:07.060
My crystal ball tells me everything.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:09.540
Now, don’t hold back,
just speak your mind.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:11.580
Okay.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.700
In short, he’s not being kind to you these days,

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:20.030
and you’re worried that he might have lost interest in you.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.510
That’s how it is.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:29.720
Aw, frankly, your boyfriend
is a bad guy!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.960
Maybe you’d better just
break up with him.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.140
No! I don’t want to!

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:41.640
You know, Aoyama-kun is such
a kind, serious, wonderful guy!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:46.200
Then, how about just
trusting him more?

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.250
You said he’s wonderful, right?

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:50.910
Yes!

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:55.080
Well, I’ll check your compatibility with your boyfriend.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.920
Hmmmm...

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.220
How did it go?

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.180
You and he are good for each other.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.180
R-Really?!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.800
But you’d better be honest about your feelings.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:17.880
Honest about my feelings...?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:21.470
Yes, and you will surely
be a happy bride.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.150
H-Happy bride?!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.540
<i>You’re so beautiful, Ichigo!</i>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.000
Ooh, a happy bride...!!!

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.030
Excuse me, but can I have the next girl come in now?

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:37.790
Wah~! Sorry!

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.830
Thank you so much!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.640
Hi, everyone!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.820
Sorry I’m late.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:55.100
I WILL work really hard to make up for it, ~Nya!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.650
What’s with her?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.310
She’s so excited.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.340
Ichigo saw a fortune teller! A fortune teller!

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:02.600
A fortune teller?

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.280
Now, I will work really hard
today too!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:09.350
I bet the fortune teller told her something
nice and she took it seriously.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.250
lchigo-san, what did you consult the fortune teller about?

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.780
Well... it’s a... secret.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.750
It must be about Aoyama-oniichan!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.320
Oh, you’re so nosy Bu-Ling!
Want to hear about it?

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.470
I do! I do!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.640
Do this first, will you?

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:29.910
Okay.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.220
Oh, I know! Akasaka-san!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.390
Hey.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.090
Akasaka-san!

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:37.710
Oh, it’s you, Ichigo-san?

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.800
Can I have some cake when I go home today?

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.110
Of course you can...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.100
Thank you!!!

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.600
You’re so nice, Akasaka-san!

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.900
I’ve come here being honest about my feelings, just like Mariko-senpai said, but...

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:58.540
This makes me so nervous...

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.410
Ichigo?!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.100
I’m sorry for dropping by
all of a sudden...

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:11.800
No, I’m the one who should be sorry;
my club is keeping me really busy.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:14.000
I’m so glad you came.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.020
Now, please come in.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.340
Thanks!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.020
Aoyama-kun...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:26.050
Following Mariko-senpai’s advice
gave me good luck yesterday.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:27.990
I have to go thank her for it.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.140
Y’know, like, he’s so cool, isn’t he?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:33.310
Excuse me,

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.310
Yup yup!

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.400
is Mariko-senpai here?

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.480
She went out a while ago.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.320
She did? Thank you.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.080
Where’s Mariko-senpai, I wonder?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.220
There she is.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.270
What is she looking at...?

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.710
You played well, Shunsuke!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.180
Oh, thanks.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.640
Mariko-senpai...

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:15.240
Could it be that... she loves him?

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.800
Yo, Mariko!

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.330
Shunsuke?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.450
You came to watch me
a while ago, right?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.790
No way! I was there by chance.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:34.960
Is that so?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.470
By the way, I heard you’re pretty good at fortune-telling.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.840
The girls were very excited.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.550
Y-Yes, I’m good at it.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:46.260
Oh yeah, I’ll do fortune-telling for you too, Shunsuke.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:49.100
Nope... I don’t think I need that.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.560
Come on, just let me do it.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.830
You have someone you love, right?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.490
Eh? Umm... kind of...

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.860
It seems you and she
are a good match.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.040
Are you sure?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.950
Trust me. I’m really good
at fortune-telling.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.240
Tell her you love her, and everything will go well.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:16.040
But well, she’s not so naive...

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.850
What kind of girl is she?

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:23.230
She’s a bit fierce, but she’s cute;
like she’s my sister or something.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:30.800
Well, the lucky day to tell her is Sunday,
the day after tomorrow.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.360
The lucky place will be a park where there’s a fountain.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:38.270
Maybe I should go for it,
if you think so.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.330
Yep. Good luck!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.990
Mariko-senpai!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.360
Ichigo-chan?

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.460
Thanks so much for your
advice yesterday.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:56.050
I took your advice about being honest
and a lucky thing did happen!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.370
Is that so? Glad to hear that.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.300
Thanks!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:04.500
Umm... Mariko-senpai, don’t YOU have anyone you love?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.500
Eh?

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:10.430
During lunch break, I saw you looking
at a guy from the soccer club...

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:16.680
Are you okay with that? You advised him
to confess his love to someone else.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.140
Were you listening to us?

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.360
I-I’m sorry...

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:22.860
It’s okay.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:26.320
Besides, you probably misunderstood.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.590
That guy is just a childhood friend.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:35.330
Mariko-senpai really does love him...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:41.000
I heard you’ve located the Mew Aqua.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:44.170
Yes. Go and investigate it right away.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.550
To determine whether it’s real or not,

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:50.190
you have to put your
Mew Aqua drop near the object.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.550
And? Where is the object?

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:54.190
This is it.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:10:00.070
Since ancient times, humans have used
crystal balls to foresee the future.

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.870
Heh, that’s so unscientific!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:07.330
However, if there is a crystal ball
that can tell the future...

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.490
It should contain Mew Aqua.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:11.740
Eh? Is that possible?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:12.820
Who knows?

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:16.710
But the power of Mew Aqua is beyond our imagination.

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:21.500
This is the girl who has that crystal ball.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.670
Alright.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:40.640
<i>The lucky day to tell her is Sunday,
the day after tomorrow.</i>

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:44.360
<i>The lucky place will be a park where there’s a fountain.</i>

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:49.370
Is Shunsuke-san really going to tell her he loves her?

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.250
Here he comes!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.080
W-What should I do?

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:01.040
Wahha! Mariko-senpai?!?!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.500
Ichigo-chan...?

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.290
What are you doing out here?

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.560
Err, I-I’m just taking a walk here.

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:10.090
In this weird place under the tree?

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:12.340
What are YOU doing here?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:13.700
I-I’m just... umm...

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.390
I guess you should be honest about your feelings, senpai!

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:23.120
You’re such a nosy girl!

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:31.480
Senpai, are you really okay with this?

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.950
Shunsuke-san confessing his love
to someone else?

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:38.120
Can’t be helped. You can’t change
his love by fortune telling.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:43.840
But you’re the one who told me
to be honest about my feelings.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.420
Senpai, now is the time to be honest.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.140
It’s still not too late, Mariko-senpai!

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.100
You know, I’ll be okay as long as he’s happy.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.350
He’s my childhood friend,
and I care for him deeply.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.530
Isn’t there something else
you care about?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.060
Who’s there?

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.520
So you’re after it too, Ichigo.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:08.240
Quiche!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.710
But I can’t let you get the Mew Aqua, Ichigo!

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:13.360
What’re you talking about?!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.420
Who the heck is he?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.860
Quit acting as if you didn’t know!

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.590
I know you want her crystal ball.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.340
Eh? You mean...

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.050
Hey, give it to me right now!

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:26.970
Run, senpai!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.760
Mariko...?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:29.920
Hurry!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:30.630
But...

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:31.530
Just do it!

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.470
Oops! I won’t let you go!

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.350
Mariko...

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:45.910
Mariko!

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.160
What the hell are you!?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.120
Shunsuke!!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.870
Run! Mariko...!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:02.280
Uh-oh, I got a weird sprit.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.510
Oh well, I can use it anyway.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.720
Shunsuke! Shunsuke!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.670
FUSION!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.270
(I’M AN ELEPHANT~~~!)

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:21.350
Shunsuke! Shunsuke!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:30.030
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:09.160
(I’M STRONG~~~!)

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.370
(OUCH!)

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:16.360
How dare you mess up the situation,

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.120
when she’s just about to be honest with herself,

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.410
trying to be someone who’s more
than his childhood friend!

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.920
That’s unforgivable!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:28.760
Today as always, for the Earth’s future, I’ll be of service! ~Nya!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.710
It doesn’t matter what you say,

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:35.210
I still have to get the Mew Aqua!

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.020
Go! Chimera Elephant!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.700
What the heck are you?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.110
Now, just give me your crystal, okay?

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:53.870
Don’t come near! No!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.030
Mariko-senpai!

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.210
So this is it?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.550
Hey! Let go of me!

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.120
See you, Ichigo!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.420
Thanks for giving me this!

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.180
WHAT?

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.470
That’s not how it goes!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:20.850
Who’d give Mew Aqua to a bastard like you?!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.350
Mew Pudding...

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:25.820
Hey, it wasn’t easy to find you.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:27.530
Are you all right?

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.060
I’m okay!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.240
Let’s get the Mew Aqua back!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.660
(Here I come!)

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.100
Hey! Let go!

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.860
No I won’t!

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.090
You haven’t won yet!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:55.000
Shunsuke-san! I’ll turn you back now.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:16.240
I can’t do anything like this...

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.290
Blue Knight!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:24.860
Are you all right?

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:25.920
Yes.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.800
The enemy can’t move quickly.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:30.580
Attack from behind.

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:31.670
I will.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.100
Catch me if you can!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.350
Now I’m here, and here, and HERE!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.890
(What?)

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.110
StrawberBell!

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:05.670
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:12.630
(OH, my eyes and trunk!)

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.510
Retrieving! Retrieving!

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:23.850
What?

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.940
No, the Mew Aqua...!

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:29.270
ICHIGO!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.360
Mew Strawberry, catch it!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.570
Ehhh!??

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:35.650
No, it’s mine!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.000
It’s been broken!

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:47.960
Bah, this is worthless!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.290
Wait up!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:52.710
What should I do...?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.740
Don’t worry, that’s not Mew Aqua.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:56.470
Eh?

00:17:56.920 --> 00:18:00.460
Mew Aqua could never be physically damaged.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.220
Then what is it?

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.350
It’s a normal crystal.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.390
Geez, we didn’t have to fight for it this hard...

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.010
You can say that again.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:09.650
Well, but I’m glad...

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:13.070
...to see the two of them are alright.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.360
What... have we been doing here?

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.530
Why... am I here?

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.990
Mariko?!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.450
Oh, I remember... You’re just about to
make your first date with someone.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.420
Good luck!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.330
Hey! Just a minute!

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.830
Sigh, I bet you didn’t
check your email...

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:35.710
Eh?!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.760
I’ll be waiting for you at the fountain,

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.760
today at moon.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:43.760
“I’ll be waiting for you at the fountain, today at MOON”...?!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.350
What the heck is this?

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.760
Asking you out on a date!
What else could it be?

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:53.320
Oh, you’re so silly!
So you meant “at noon”?

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:56.150
How could you be waiting “at Moon”?

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.040
Don’t laugh like that,

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:02.610
I-I gathered my courage and asked you out, and you call me silly?

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:03.690
Eh?

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.450
So, I was waiting for you!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.420
But, the girl you love is...

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:17.010
<i>She’s a bit fierce, but she’s cute; like
she’s my sister or something.</i>

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.300
Don’t make me say
the same thing again!

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:25.920
Why... did you have to take such a roundabout way?!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:27.390
Shunsuke, you baka!

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:31.880
Wait. Oh, wait.
Don’t cry, I’m telling you.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:36.610
Since you’re not naive, I assumed you
wouldn’t have come if I’d asked you seriously...

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.190
Stop crying already!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.820
Congratulations, Mariko-senpai...

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.820
Did I do anything wrong?

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:46.320
Ichigo, have you heard?

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:47.110
What?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:50.070
Mariko-senpai has stopped fortune-telling.

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:52.910
Her crystal ball was broken, I heard.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:53.990
I-Is that so?

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:59.170
Besides, it turns out she was just saying random stuff while gazing at the crystal ball.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.210
Random stuff?!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:06.570
Yep, she just said anything to encourage girls.

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:11.550
Then, how about her story about my
marriage with Aoyama-kun...?

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:13.190
Ichigo! You’ll be late!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.690
Wait up!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.270
Hurry, hurry.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.610
Wait! Wait up!

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:28.420
Ichigo! I heard your father is against your love.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:33.680
Yes! Although Aoyama-kun and I are
such a super-happy couple in love...!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:36.890
It’s exciting to watch a quarrel that
has nothing to do with me.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.660
Argh, you’re like a devil, Minto!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:43.750
Next: “Father’s Back:
One-game Match for Ichigo”

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:46.210
A bride’s father has mixed emotions.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:50.840
Aw, that’s so sweet, Zakuro-san!
So I’m a “bride”?

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.350
She’s so simple and stupid!
